@baseUrl = http://localhost:5220
@token = replace-with-local-admin-token

### KPI — role admin required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/kpis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revenue months — zero-fill, chronological
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/revenue-by-month?months=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid months => 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/revenue-by-month?months=37
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Extreme page => empty items, no overflow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/courses?page=2147483647&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vietnamese search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/students?search=nguyen&pageSize=16
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid status => 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/teachers?status=Invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicit zero values allowed; omitted tuition must be 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Khoa test local","bandFrom":0,"bandTo":0.5,"totalSessions":10,"sessionsPerWeek":2,"tuition":0,"discountPercent":0}
